            "name": "CHANGELOG.md",
            "content": "---\nproject: mbl\ntype: changelog\ndocument_id: LOG-MBL-6.3\nversion: \"6.3\"\ndate: 2026-05-12\nstandard: Evo Trident 00-06\nai_context: true\n---\n\n# MBL Documentation — CHANGELOG\n\n> Tổng hợp các thay đổi qua từng phiên bản tài liệu.\n> Format: [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/) cho documentation.\n\n---\n\n## [6.3] — 2026-05-12\n\n### Added\n- `00-project/VERSION.md` — Centralized version tracker\n- `00-project/CHANGELOG.md` — Release notes tập trung (file này)\n- `00-project/nfr.md` — Non-Functional Requirements document\n- `00-project/disaster-recovery.md` — DR/BCP Plan\n- `00-project/data-migration-sap-ebao.md` — Data Migration Strategy (SAP → eBao)\n- `00-project/security-incident-response.md` — Security Incident Response Plan\n- `00-project/sla.md` — Service Level Agreements\n- `03-architecture/api-versioning-strategy.md` — API Versioning Strategy\n\n### Changed\n- Version sync: 15 files nâng từ v5.0/v5.1/v5.3/v6.0 lên v6.3\n- Updated date across all synced files to 2026-05-12\n\n### Fixed\n- Version inconsistency giữa các module (trước: 5.0–6.3, sau: 6.1–6.3)\n\n---\n\n## [6.2] — 2026-05-11\n\n### Added\n- 5KB maturity threshold enforcement cho toàn bộ 122 module files\n- Enriched frontmatter cho 12 files gần ngưỡng\n\n### Changed\n- M01 runbook: Added OP-06 Emergency Session Revoke, escalation matrix, Redis flush\n- M01 lessons: Added Timelimiter config, adoption trend data\n- M02 lessons: Added adoption metrics, remaining risks table\n- M02 user-guide: Replaced text state machine with Mermaid diagram\n- M05 lessons: Added GPS accuracy metrics, coaching adoption stats\n- M06 detailed-design: Added security considerations, DLQ handling\n- M07 test-report: Added device matrix, 5 recommendations\n\n---\n\n## [6.1] — 2026-05-07\n\n### Added\n- Evo Trident 00-06 standard applied to entire documentation\n- YAML frontmatter with `ai_context: true` cho tất cả files\n- `DOCUMENT-INDEX.md` — Master inventory với size, version, trạng thái\n- Architecture docs cho M05, M06, M07, M08, M09 (api-spec, detailed-design, rules)\n- Sprint plans cho M05–M09\n- User guides và Runbooks cho M05–M09\n- TCS và Test Reports cho M05–M08\n- Retrospective lessons cho M01–M08\n\n### Changed\n- Restructured toàn bộ theo Evo Trident 00-06 directory standard\n- Standardized RBAC matrix across all modules\n- Updated data-classification.md với PDPA compliance requirements\n\n---\n\n## [6.0] — 2026-04-28\n\n### Added\n- M08 BRD-F11: Early Collection Assessment feature\n- eBao migration impact documentation\n\n### Changed\n- M08 BRD updated for eBao PAS integration\n- Core Insurance references: SAP → eBao throughout\n\n---\n\n## [5.3] — 2026-04-15\n\n### Added\n- M01 Portal detailed-design: Service layer architecture\n- M02 Lead detailed-design: CRM-MB webhook integration patterns\n- M01/M02 test reports: Initial test execution results\n\n### Changed\n- API-spec updates for M02 Lead: new CRM-MB webhook endpoints\n\n---\n\n## [5.0] — 2026-03-01\n\n### Added\n- M05 TeamActivity: BRD, SRS, basic-design, screen-design (baseline docs)\n- Architecture documents cho M05: api-spec, detailed-design\n\n---\n\n## [4.0] — 2025-12-01\n\n### Added\n- Initial Evo Trident structure (00-project through 06-reports)\n- BRD/SRS/flow/basic-design/screen-design cho M01–M04\n- Architecture documents cho M01–M04 (api-spec, detailed-design, rules)\n- `00-project/README.md`, `architecture.md`, `api-standards.md`\n- `glossary.md`, `team.md`, `data-classification.md`\n- `rbac-matrix.md`, `lessons-learned.md`\n\n---\n\n## Version Legend\n\n| Type | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| **Added** | Tài liệu hoặc section mới |\n| **Changed** | Cập nhật nội dung existing |\n| **Fixed** | Sửa lỗi, inconsistency |\n| **Deprecated** | Sẽ bị loại bỏ trong phiên bản sau |\n| **Removed** | Đã loại bỏ |\n\n---\n\n*CHANGELOG.md v6.3 | 2026-05-12 | Centralized release notes for MBL documentation*\n",
